|Projects|Up to 3|Unlimited|Unlimited
|Storage|5 GB|100 GB|Unlimited (fair use)
|Team members|1|Up to 25|Unlimited
|Roles & permissions|—|Yes|Advanced (custom roles)
|Automations|—|1,000 runs/mo|Unlimited (policy-based)
